# Supabase — same project as the MealMind app. Required for POST /api/waitlist.
#
# Migration (run once in Supabase → SQL Editor): Web/supabase/migrations/20260507120000_waitlist_signups.sql
# (copy SQL from `create table` through `notify pgrst`; do not paste a file path into the editor).
#
# Local dev: `next.config.ts` can load MealMind/App/RecipeApp/.env when Web/.env.local is absent.
#
# Vercel: Project → Settings → Environment Variables (Production + Preview). Redeploy after saving.
# Vercel does not read MealMind/App/RecipeApp/.env — set variables on the host.
#
# Recommended (server-only; never NEXT_PUBLIC_*): service role bypasses RLS so waitlist always works.
SUPABASE_URL=https://YOUR_PROJECT_REF.supabase.co
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=your_supabase_service_role_secret
#
# Alternative: anon key + RLS insert policy (see Web/supabase/migrations/20260507120000_waitlist_signups.sql).
# SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your_supabase_anon_key
#
# Also accepted for URL/key: NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_* or EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_* (same as the mobile app).

# Optional: YouTube video id only (e.g. dQw4w9WgXcQ) for the landing “Watch” section embed.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_LANDING_YOUTUBE_ID=
